log-for-linux takes the GNU LGPL v3 option: the FSF licence list
(https://www.gnu.org/licenses/license-list.html) names LGPLv3 as compatible
with GPLv3, the licence of the app. The LGPL text is COPYING.LGPL-3 next to
this file; the GNU GPL v3 it builds on is LICENSE at the top of the tree.
